### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- 1. **Content Generation** — Generate platform-optimized posts from a content database (CSV/JSON). Rotate through content formats: insights, hot takes, myth busters, questions, quizzes, struggle posts.
- 4. **Smart Scheduling** — Post at configurable time slots via GitHub Actions cron. Multiple slots per day, different content per slot.
- ## Setup
- ### Required Environment Variables
- X_API_KEY=your_x_api_key
- X_API_SECRET=your_x_api_secret
- X_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_x_access_token
- X_ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=your_x_access_token_secret
- IG_USER_ID=your_instagram_user_id
- IG_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_instagram_access_token
- META_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_meta_page_token
- META_PAGE_ID=your_meta_page_id
- ### Required Files
- - `data/questions.csv` or `data/content.csv` — Your content database
- - `templates/` — Optional custom templates for video generation
- ### Content Database Format
- CSV with columns: `question, option1, option2, option3, option4, correctIndex, explanation, subject, year`
- Or any CSV — the agent adapts the posting format to your data structure.
- - **"Post thread"** — Generate and post a data-driven thread on X
- - **"Generate video"** — Create a reel/short from content
- - **"Add content [text]"** — Add new content to the database
- - **"Change hashtags"** — Update hashtag strategy
- - **"Analytics"** — Show posting stats
- ## How It Works
- The agent uses pre-written content pools with human-sounding variations. No two posts look the same. Content is rotated by day-of-week format:
- - Monday/Friday: Insights (data-driven observations)
- - Tuesday: Hot takes (opinion posts that invite debate)
- - Wednesday: Questions (engagement-driving open questions)
- - Thursday: Myth busters (common misconceptions debunked)
- - Saturday: Quiz (actual questions from your database)
- - Sunday: Struggle/motivation (relatable journey posts)
- ## Video Generation
- Videos are generated using HTML→PNG→MP4 pipeline:
- - 8 color themes auto-rotating
- - Dynamic text from your content database
- - 1080x1920 (9:16) for Reels/Shorts
- - Background music from included library
- - Branded watermark
- ## Niche Adaptable
- This skill works for ANY niche — not just education. Swap the content database and the agent adapts:
- - Fitness coaches → workout tips, myth busters
- - Finance pages → market data, investment questions
- - Tech reviewers → comparison posts, hot takes
- - Food bloggers → recipe quizzes, ingredient facts
- Built by a developer running this system 24/7 for their own social media. Battle-tested, not theoretical.
+ 1. **Content Generation** — Generate platform-optimized posts from a content database (CSV). Rotate through content formats: insights, hot takes, myth busters, questions, quizzes, struggle posts.
